================================================================================
EDGE-ROLE METADATA LEGEND  (every input/output wire carries exactly one [role])
================================================================================
INPUT roles:
  [construction] the box computes its output from this wire (appears in the body)
  [read]         a retained object / packet / context is read or carried, not recomputed
  [source]       a typed source port, opened not derived (no internal producer)
  [pairing]      a component combined into a typed input signature (the "+"), not constructed
  [read-as]      the same object reinterpreted under a new type role (e.g. coeff-row -> endpoint eqn)
  [coherence]    enforces same-state / no-reselection (asserts, does not construct)
