/-
================================================================================
STATE-SHAPE BATCH
Section 7.6, Sub-layer 03, Sub-box 03

Incoming state shape:
  monotone_cubic_certificate_interfaces GSeq
  left_low_ruled_out GSeq

Outgoing state shape:
  right_low_ruled_out GSeq

Effect:
  Derives generic right-certificate nonexistence by reading right certificate
  data as left certificate data on the reversed profile. For a selected
  right-low branch, the interface constructs the certificate and the explicit
  endpoint-reversal lemma connects the branch shape to the left obstruction.

Public theorem:
  build_right_low_ruled_out
