/- ## Sub-container 8.3: The leading descendant matrix. -/

/- Sub-layer 01 -/
/-
Paper ref: 8.3
Sub-box Label: `Leading descendant matrix L_b and RHS eta: substitute the frozen endpoint coefficient pattern and the endpoint interval sums I_ij=g_i+...+g_{j-1}, assert the top homogeneous obstruction vanishes, and read the linear shadow L_b: R_desc x {0,1,2,3} -> Q with system L_b g = eta`
