def rank_trichotomy_section_8_3_sub_layer_01_sub_box_01_label : String := "Leading descendant matrix L_b and RHS eta: substitute the frozen endpoint coefficient pattern and the endpoint interval sums I_ij=g_i+...+g_{j-1}, assert the top homogeneous obstruction vanishes, and read the linear shadow L_b: R_desc x {0,1,2,3} -> Q with system L_b g = eta"
