Section 8.3, Sub-layer 02, Sub-box 02
Birth token: rank_source

This box computes the retained rank from the exact matrix and attaches the
three already selected conditional branch packets from the same rank-layer
source.  It does not synthesize any branch certificate from the numeral `rho`.
