STATE-SHAPE BATCH
Section 8.3, Sub-layer 02, Sub-box 02

Incoming state shape:
  leading_descendant_matrix opening leadingData
  rank_regime_source opening leadingData regimeData

Outgoing state shape:
  rank_source opening leadingData regimeData

Effect:
  Defines `rho` to be the matrix rank over `Q`, proves the four-column rank
  bound, and retains the rank-four, rank-three, and rank-at-most-two source
  packets over that same matrix.  The source packets remain conditional on
  their own regimes and are not derived from the rank number.

Public theorem:
  build_rank_source
================================================================================
