Effect:
  Uses one source selection for both Section 8.3 boxes.  The first box derives
  the exact linear system from the quadratic rows and the source decomposition.
  The second computes the rank and attaches the three conditional regime
  packets over that same matrix.  The source selection is existentially sealed
  in the parent frontier, while the same `S_0` remains available to Section 8.4.

Public theorem:
