Sub-box Label: `Forked rank/coloring output components: rank four impossible, rank-three handoff on its branch, or low-rank coloring data on its branch, all over the same endpoint-address system`
Sub-inputs: `rank_fork`, `rank_four_impossible`, `rank_three_affine_handoff`, `low_rank_coloring_datum`, `S_0`
Sub-outputs: `S_rank_components`
Note: The rank-three and low-rank outputs are alternatives, not simultaneous retained states. The closed prefix survivor K is not produced here.
