/-- The interval-sum source at one fixed conflict edge. -/
def prefix_conflict_interval_sum_source
    (data : PrefixIntervalSectorData)
    (e : Section6.K5EdgeAddress) : Prop :=
  ∀ m : ℕ,
    prefixIntervalEdgeIntervals data m e =
      prefixAdjacentGapInterval
        (prefixIntervalAdjacentGaps data) m e

/--
The complete paper-grain predicate for one prefix-cone conflict datum.

The directions, edge, and gap witnesses are parameters of the datum.  The
proof fields assert that they belong to the exact retained projective model,
interval packet, and low-rank closure state.  No certificate row is selected by
this definition.
