One exact branch-indexed finite prefix-conflict family.

For every compatible member of `C_2(chi)`, the row values are the fixed
projections of the retained certificate at that same cycle address.  The row
predicate also contains the exact interval-sector packet and lower-layer
closure read used to type the certificate row.
