def prefix_conflict_section_9_5_sub_layer_02_sub_box_02_label : String := "Prefix compression and fixation of K: assuming the low-rank selected-coloring route of S_rank and the finite prefix-conflict family, every compatible C5+C5 prefix branch is eliminated and the prefix layer retains the closed prefix survivor K"
