The paper-level output of Section 9 is not only the final `K` proof.  The
section closes the selected low-rank prefix route once, then exports the fixed
survivor `K`, the monochrome low-rank datum `FG_mono`, and the same-`K`
no-reselection capability used by the later shared-state coherence batch.

The finite prefix certificate remains a theorem-source input to this section.
It is consumed here and is not copied into the output packet.
