STATE-SHAPE PARENT BATCH
Container 4, Layer 06, Boxes 27-28
Section 9 complete prefix conflict and fixed-survivor composition

Incoming state shape:
  RankTrichotomy.low_rank_route C nSeq dSeq opening
  Section6.Legacy.legacy_S_0 C nSeq dSeq
    (openingTSeq opening) (openingBSeq opening) (openingZSeq opening)
  finite_prefix_certificate C nSeq dSeq opening

Outgoing state shape:
