Effect:
  On one exact sourceData, substitutes tau_i = tau into
  s_i = tau_i * kappa_i and then into the exact affine-gap equation, obtaining
  g_i(T) = kappa_i * (T + tau) for all four adjacent gaps.  No endpoint
  equation, endpoint collision, or terminal theorem is used.

